  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAND CONSERVATION &amp; MANAGEMENT FOR MIGRA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will: 1) Acquire in perpetuity 263.94 acres/106.81 hectares that will be added to the..Zapotal Conservation Area. 2) Manage habitat in Ra Lagartos Biosphere Reserve, Yum Balam..reserve and Zapotal Conservation Area to mitigate forest fires, strengthen coastal ecosystem services,..and promote positive effects for birds on the landscape. 3) Conduct experimental fire management..activities that will help in developing a program of prescribed burns. 4) Monitor birds to evaluate the..recovery of ecosystem services. 5) Raise local awareness about fire management and bird..conservation through training workshops, outreach and community monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
